  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Outside Iron Eagle blessed land he sits with Meng Si among Meng tribe Gu Immortals watching Yao tribe arrivals. He stares at Yao Zi Han and Yao Ju and explains that Yao Zi Han’s purple light eyes come from Yao tribe’s signature killer move purple jade eyes, which can see through blessed lands and grotto-heavens so Yao tribe knows the situation inside Iron Eagle blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        1105
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_iron_eagle_blessed_land",
        "fac_meng_tribe",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_yao_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has dark yellow skin. Like Meng Si he is middle aged, thick bearded, armored, bare armed with bulging muscles, and wears short pants without shoes.",
      "chapters": [
        1105
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "During the scramble he shouts that he, Meng Ji, is here and asks who dares to fight him.",
      "chapters": [
        1106
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "iron-eagle-loot",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Hui Feng Zi flies from an eagle nest, Meng Ji is furious and stares fixedly at him for snatching what Meng Ji claims as his.",
      "chapters": [
        1108
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "iron-eagle-loot",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hui_feng_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hei Tie Sheng targets him as the closest Meng tribe rank seven Gu Immortal and shouts for his life. Meng Ji fights back courageously for several rounds, then the proud and arrogant Meng Ji turns and flees. Hei Tie Sheng fights by trading injuries and trying to go down together; after several times Meng Ji cannot stand it and retreats.",
      "chapters": [
        1109
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "flight-from-hei-tie-sheng",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_tie_sheng"
      ]
    }
  ],
